{
  "title": "Yellow Spicy Malaysian Rice Noodles",
  "description": "A fermented, springy, and satvik-friendly Malaysian dish featuring mustard seeds and beurre-monte, perfect for midnight cravings. This recipe combines the flavors of Malaysia with a twist of French cuisine.",
